\"w-full h-full object-cover saturate-[1.15] contrast-[1.04]\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:28px\"><span style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" class=\"font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#D92B2B] font-bold block\">DOUBLE VISION // <!-- -->Monsoon Moments</span><p class=\"font-serif text-[17px] text-[#111111]/85 leading-[1.6]\">ShutterScape was created for students who love to<!-- --> <span class=\"font-semibold text-[#111111] underline decoration-[#D4A843] decoration-2 underline-offset-4\">observe, capture, and tell stories</span> <!-- -->through photographs. Whether you shoot on a<!-- --> <span style=\"padding:1px 6px\" class=\"rounded bg-[#FFF3BF] text-[#8C6D1F] font-mono text-[10.5px] font-bold\">35mm SLR</span>, a<!-- --> <span style=\"padding:1px 6px\" class=\"rounded bg-[#E7F5FF] text-[#1864AB] font-mono text-[10.5px] font-bold\">mirrorless rig</span>, or your<!-- --> <span style=\"padding:1px 6px\" class=\"rounded bg-[#EBFBEE] text-[#2B8A3E] font-mono text-[10.5px] font-bold\">phone</span> <!-- -->—<!-- --> <span class=\"italic font-semibold text-[#D92B2B]\">there is a place for you in our darkroom.</span></p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"mobile-chronology-matrix\" class=\"relative z-20 w-full bg-[#070709] text-white border-t border-white/10 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-25\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(ellipse 65% 45% at 50% 25%, rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.22) 0%, transparent 75%)\"></div><div style=\"padding:58px 20px 14px\" class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center gap-2 w-full max-w-md mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"font-script text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-bold tracking-normal leading-[0.9]\"><span class=\"text-white drop-shadow-sm\">Frames in </span><span class=\"text-[#EF4444] drop-shadow-[0_0_35px_rgba(239,68,68,0.45)]\">Motion</span></h2><p class=\"font-sans text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-gray-400 font-medium tracking